DTSTAMP:20261009T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261102
SUMMARY:2027 ARC/PLC signup opens (FSA)
DESCRIPTION:FSA signup for the 2027 crop year opens. It runs to Mar 15\, 2027.\nCompare ARC and PLC for your county: https://agsist.com/arc-plc\nSource: https://www.fsa.usda.gov/news-events/news/09-15-2026/usda-announces-2026-2027-enrollment-key-price-revenue-safety-net
URL:https://agsist.com/arc-plc
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-12-11-arc-plc-2026-signup-deadline@agsist.com
DTSTAMP:20261009T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261211
SUMMARY:2026 ARC/PLC signup deadline (FSA)
DESCRIPTION:Last day to sign 2026 ARC or PLC at your FSA office. A farm with no 2026 election keeps its 2025 election but gets no 2026 payment.\nCompare ARC and PLC for your county: https://agsist.com/arc-plc\nSource: https://www.fsa.usda.gov/news-events/news/09-15-2026/usda-announces-2026-2027-enrollment-key-price-revenue-safety-net
URL:https://agsist.com/arc-plc
END:VEVENT
